  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Uganda&apos;s Response to HIV/AIDS - Uganda (01-Jul-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda, TB/HIV, The AIDS Support Organisation (Uganda) Limited (TASO)This program has the following goals: An effective and sustainable multi-sectoral HIV/AIDs service delivery system that ensures universal access and coverage of quality, efficient and safe services to the targeted population by 2020.  To contribute to the reduction of HIV new infection by 77% by 2025.  To improve quality of life of PLHIV and decrease HIV- associated mortality by 70% by 2025.  To reduce vulnerability to HIV/AIDs and Mitigation of its impact on PLHIV and other vulnerable groups. The objectives of this program are: To increase condom use at high risk sex from 50% to 75%.  To increase equitable access to ART by those in need from 50% (2014) to 80% by 2018</narrative>
  </description>
